'''Haunted''' is a [[common Weapons|common]] knife that was obtainable by purchasing the 4th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2018|2018 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading  as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is dark turquoise with a minimalist haunted house in front of a glowing yellow moon imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is dull purple, and the handle is dark purple.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Haunted (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Haunted_Set Haunted Set].

